   "task_message": "Find out whether you are speaking with {{title}} {{last_name}}. Only 'yes', 'that's me', 'speaking' or the customer's own name confirms it; 'hello', 'go ahead' or 'who is this' do not. If it is unclear, answer any question they asked first (without saying why you call), then ask once more: 'Am I speaking with {{title}} {{last_name}}?'. Say nothing about why you are calling. If the call ends here, thank them, say goodbye, then call end_call.",
